Description: flash-runner, Flash for Chrome, Chromium and Edge, with the online game helper
 Installs the extension, which Chrome, Chromium and Edge add by themselves the
 next time they start, and the helper that lets games open the raw TCP sockets
 a browser cannot. It replaces the standalone flash-helper package.
 Contains Adobe Flash Player, proprietary software of Adobe Inc. / HARMAN,
